Analyzing Spatially Continuous Data:
====================================

Spatially continuous data sets included with S+SpatialStats:

aquifer
coal.ash
iron.ore
scallops

------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Basic Plots for  Spatially Continuous Data:

par(mfrow = c(1, 3))
plot(aquifer)

par(mfrow = c(2, 2), pty = "s")
plot(aquifer$easting, aquifer$northing)
hist(aquifer$head)

