Theoretical Variogram Models and Fitting a Theoretical Variogram:

par (mfrow = c (2, 2))
vdist _ 1:240
vrange _ 120
vsill _ 600000
plot (vdist, exp.vgram(distance = vdist, range = vrange, sill = 600000), 
  type = "l")
plot (vdist, spher.vgram(distance = vdist, range = vrange, sill = 600000), 
  type = "l")
plot (vdist, gauss.vgram(distance = vdist, range = vrange, sill = 600000), 
  type = "l")
plot (aqu.varrobust, main = "Variogram (Robust)")

> model.variogram(aqu.varrobust, fun = gauss.vgram,
