Trend Surface Models:

aqu.lm1 _ lm (head ~ easting + northing, data = aquifer, x = T, y = T)

> aqu.lm1
Call:
lm(formula = head ~ easting + northing, data = aquifer, x = T, y = T)

Coefficients:
 (Intercept)   easting  northing 
    2591.327 -6.751872 -5.986175

Degrees of freedom: 85 total; 82 residual
Residual standard error: 203.3075 


aqu.lm2 _ lm (head ~ easting * northing, data = aquifer, x = T, y = T)

> aqu.lm2
Call:
lm(formula = head ~ easting * northing, data = aquifer, x = T, y = T)

Coefficients:
 (Intercept)   easting  northing easting:northing 
    2626.994 -8.288185 -6.647954       0.02453368

Degrees of freedom: 85 total; 81 residual
Residual standard error: 191.9555 


par (mfrow = c (2, 3))
plot (aqu.lm1)
plot (aqu.lm2)


par (mfrow = c (1, 2))
b0 _ coefficients(aqu.lm1)[1]
b1 _ coefficients(aqu.lm1)[2]
b2 _ coefficients(aqu.lm1)[3]
aqu.pred _ b0 + b1 * aquifer$easting + b2 * aquifer$northing

aqu.interppred _ interp (x = aquifer$easting, y = aquifer$northing, 
  z = aqu.pred / 1000)

persp (aqu.interp, zlab = "Z / 1000", eye = c(300, -1500, 15))
persp (aqu.interppred, zlab = "Z / 1000", eye = c(300, -1500, 15))

